The per-object evidence is striking: object_6, object_7, and object_9 each show 11 empty looks at receptacle_19 during weekday 9–17h versus only 2 positive finds. object_12 shows 8 empty versus 5 found. The 11-empty pattern for the first three is too consistent to be random; it indicates the objects are physically absent from the house for most of the workday. The 3 "against" sightings in existing commuter documents (p_d6c3, p_c4d1, p_1c5e) suggest the resident occasionally works from home or the departure/return times shift by an hour.

